# The raw runner's append-only journals merge by union, never by text:
# two writers (session passes via main, the hourly CI pass on
# raw-osint/auto) append at the same end, so a text merge always
# conflicts there.  The driver is scripts/raw_assets/journal_merge.py;
# without `git config merge.ludus-journal.driver ...` git falls back to
# its normal merge (CLAUDE.md TABOO 0.25 p. 5, TABOO 0.012 p. 5).
docs/RAW_OSINT_CURSOR.json merge=ludus-journal
docs/RAW_CODE_CANDIDATES.json merge=ludus-journal
docs/RAW_PROPS_REGISTER.jsonl merge=ludus-journal
